cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Function-generated arithmetics: catalogue, structural classification and numerical limits"
message: "If you use this code or the accompanying paper, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Szulia
    given-names: Maciej
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/maciejszulia/function-generated-arithmetics"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and numerical verification of operations
  a (+) b = g^{-1}(g(a) + g(b)) for ten generators, with a structural
  classification (group, monoid, semigroup) and a negative result for the
  non-associative synergy variant.
keywords:
  - non-Newtonian calculus
  - transport of structure
  - generalized arithmetic
  - Lambert W function
  - numerical verification
